  "independentChecks": [
    "Selected BARY/GS helper closure uses only proper E/W port degree1 adjacency after actual loop preprocessor; same full default math/RNG code can operate on checked <=176nodes/392ports/196proper segments, no internal64 branch.",
    "REVERSED lexical occurrences independently scanned across worker; selected default crossing/BK/ORTHO helper bodies do not read it. Interactive crossing does read it but its strategy is excluded. CYCLIC has only declaration/global-name and writes, no default late read.",
    "BK buildFor/determineAllLeft/RightNeighbors traverse actual edge lists; restored NORTH empty-adjacency ports add no neighbor. getBlocks/threshold/full inherited phases remain current math, actual loop-expanded margins retained.",
    "Ordinary ORTHO uses side/type predicate port iterator, not cached side ranges; horizontal ratio counts nonempty adjacencies so restored empty NORTH ports add0. No requirement for zero margin or nonnegative internalY.",
    "Read actual AlgorithmAssembler constructor assigning EnumBasedFactoryComparator, ordinal compare_109/$compare_27/Enum.compareTo; retrieveProcessors sorts by this comparator. Read phase-config lambda/apply dispatch, nonnull predicates, union callback, cached factory retrieval and Orthogonal prototype delegation. Enum-relative insertion matches the real no-loop19/loop23 sequences, retaining distinct BARY and GS instances.",
    "Read literal splitter single-pass decide/identity set, splitAt exactly one new partner per selected initial segment and subsequent dependency update. <=28 original nonself edges cross a particular layer boundary at most once: <=28 initial route segments, <=56 aftersplit, <=392 over7 internal boundaries, within signed32. <=196 is the proper LEdge bound rather than an unjustified private-segment bound.",
    "Typed current E06 prefix dependency IDs/seals resolved against all three current source documents, including approved NS, loop4 and proposed A split/import plus R scans/NodeSize. A pending target source approval is not silently promoted by this review; global gate must wait and rebinding drift requires new review.",
    "Exact pinned Git/NPM worker bytes, baseline/context canonical hash, each selected component seal, every LF/UTF16 function span, lexical callsite and typed E05 artifact/pointer/component seal independently recomputed. Prototype binding records now use actual symbols, explanatory text is separate role."
  ],
